[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:A Famous Actress]
[00:00.76]Lesson 127 | 第127课
[00:03.24]A famous actress | 著名的女演员
[00:05.96]Listen to the tape then answer this question. | 听录音，然后回答问题。
[00:11.62]Who is only twenty-nine, and why is it so unclear? | 谁才29岁？为什么这点不清楚？
[00:19.40]Can you recognize that woman, Liz? | 莉兹，你认得出那个女人吗？
[00:24.72]I think I can, Kate. | 我想我认得，凯特。
[00:27.86]It must be Karen Marsh, the actress. | 她肯定是女演员卡伦·马什。
[00:32.96]I thought so. | 我也这么想。
[00:34.83]Who's that beside her? | 她旁边的那个人是谁？
[00:37.91]That must be Conrad Reeves. | 那肯定是康拉德·里夫斯。
[00:42.27]Conrad Reeves, the actor? | 演员康拉德·里夫斯？
[00:45.66]It can't be. | 不可能。
[00:47.32]Let me have another look. | 我再看看。
[00:50.69]I think you're right! | 我想你是对的！
[00:53.24]Isn't he her third husband? | 他不是她的第三任丈夫吗？
[00:56.90]No. | 不。
[00:58.86]He must be her fourth or fifth. | 他肯定是她的第四任或第五任丈夫。
[01:03.09]Doesn't Karen Marsh look old! | 卡伦·马什看起来真老啊！
[01:07.12]She does, doesn't she! | 是啊，她看起来确实老！
[01:10.64]I read she's twenty-nine, but she must be at least forty. | 我读到她29岁，但她至少有40岁了。
[01:18.60]I'm sure she is. | 我敢肯定她是。
[01:21.91]She was a famous actress when I was still at school. | 我还在上学的时候，她就是一位著名的女演员了。
[01:28.24]That was a long time ago, wasn't it? | 那是很久以前的事了，不是吗？
[01:33.00]Not that long ago! | 没那么久！
[01:35.88]I'm not more than twenty-nine myself. | 我自己也不超过29岁。